Usage: codebase-memory-mcp cli [--quiet] [--progress] [--verbose] [--json] <tool_name> [json_args]
  --quiet     Show errors only; cannot combine with --progress or outer --verbose
  --progress  Show lifecycle progress even when stderr is redirected
  --verbose   Include informational logs (preserves CBM_LOG_LEVEL=debug)
  --json      Print the raw MCP result envelope
